know there was a natural alternative." - Sarah F.</span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="71a8e179-62cf-46d8-b81d-887b8f1c9b80" class="r-nh6nu5"><div data-rid="60eebf4d-6206-4449-bef6-1348de7bdb16" class="r-4jnqsa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Why Haven't You Heard About This Before?</span></strong></h2></span></div><picture data-rid="2e6115ca-86f1-47b4-9e96-960ec8204b0d" class="r-rjvemo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/7.png?v=1737206212&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928" class="r-x4231g" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="9cf40ce9-3dfe-4dec-930d-ee7bad9659a3" class="r-7i6g2r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Many of my patients ask me, "Why didn't anyone tell me about this sooner?" The truth is, there are very few natural solutions specifically designed to address period pain and support hormones. </span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Most healthcare providers have limited time with patients and may not be familiar with nutritional approaches to menstrual health.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Additionally, in my experience, I've found that most care tends to focus on managing symptoms rather than addressing underlying factors. </span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">While I understand this approach has its place, I believe it often leaves women without the comprehensive support they need during major hormonal transitions.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">That's why I'm passionate about sharing this information. Women deserve to know all their options, especially when making important decisions about their health.</span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="506651c5-d992-46e2-aff8-3fe0f567a3a0" class="r-nlnylu"><div data-rid="6031b5f9-01c9-4103-a595-986737c91da8" class="r-shntgg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Supporting Your Transition</span></strong></h2></span></div><picture data-rid="e4414170-da55-4798-9e5e-1bfdd9f85417" class="r-n8mazy"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/3_8d129a53-f7f1-4f47-a916-b9d01c0747a2.png?v=1737206211&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/5d953427-89a6-4b08-bc52-6e5ea8b42928" class="r-2y4kag" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="6c759595-14b1-4dee-9242-b548c75d2a84" class="r-1ww0lwu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">If you're considering stopping birth control and are worried about your period pain returning, know that you have options. The fear of returning symptoms shouldn't be the only thing keeping you on birth control if you're otherwise ready to stop.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">monthlies is designed to be simple: just mix one tropical-flavored scoop into water each morning. It provides comprehensive support for your cycle, whether you're transitioning off birth control or simply looking for natural period pain relief.</span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="adc40f12-f55e-4953-a8fe-64c778e3eab8" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ee554158-1457-4f55-a9ba-eb48f9c10178-attributes-color:#d43a32" class="r-wo12md"><div data-rid="bf241764-e185-4351-9ee0-bae5f13f1fc0" class="r-cabhlk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Try monthlies Risk-Free</span></strong></h2></span></div><picture data-rid="a31cfa7e-994b-43bb-b9d5-19b6a4fcf17e" class="r-8kuw5c"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/2_7e544fa7-afba-4e17-9e48-f297a829d1d1.png?v=1737644092&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/a26b1bff-ca41-4d48-8202-8171b1bbe35b?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/a26b1bff-ca41-4d48-8202-8171b1bbe35b?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/a26b1bff-ca41-4d48-8202-8171b1bbe35b" alt="Hand holding a dropper above two black serum bottles on a counter." class="r-x0sb0e" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="1b5b5cf6-883b-473e-bfc4-98c920eb6b97" class="r-1ehkrzj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">We're confident in the science behind monthlies, but we understand that every woman's body is different. </span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">That's why we offer a 90-day money-back guarantee. If you take monthlies consistently for 3 months and don't notice a difference, simply return the empty container for a refund of your first order.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">As a small team of health practitioners and women who've experienced period pain ourselves,